<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14487" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">distrĭbūtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		distribuo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a division</i>, <i>distribution.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caeli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. 2, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">invidiae et criminum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Clu. 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">utilis rerum ac partium in locos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					7, 1, 1</span></i>
			.—In plur.,
				<i><span class="en">Cic. Part. 2, 7</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> As a fig. of speech, the resolution
			of a statement or idea into several, <i><span class="en">Cic. de
				Or. 3, 53, 203</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 4, 35,
				47</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In arch., <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1, 2 <i>fin.</i></span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
